            "review_title": "Review at Nia Cafe",
            "review_text": "Noo\nQuang Binh Province, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\n😍😍\nSep 2023 • Solo\nUm great...\nThis is a place with a quite peaceful and sometimes bustling space, a place with a comfortable study space for young people studying for exams. It is a romantic place every evening for couples coming to Nia. Coming here, you can listen to the emotional music of the cashier😂😂.... admire the innocent and agile fish, hear the popping sound every time you feed them. Coming to this place, you will come into contact with friendly, sociable and vooooo cute staff🤩...and enjoy the shop's natural fruits when they are in season. Don't hesitate to take a moment. time to blend into Nia's innocent environment.\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten September 13, 2023",
