            "review_title": "Review at Nia Cafe",
            "review_text": "Thái D\n2 contributions\n0\nFood 5*. Service 5*. Space 5*. Total 5^\nAug 2023 • Friends\nThe shop is located in the center of the city, there are a lot of motorbikes, even on the side of the shop, making it quite difficult for cars to park properly.\n- Spacious space, architecture blends into nature, dominated by wood and green trees with bamboo. There are 2 Koi fish ponds alternating between the space in front and behind the shop.\n- The shop has an air-conditioned room on the 2nd floor. Next time we come, we will try it out.\n- Many models of tables and chairs depending on customer needs.\n\n- Order at the counter, take the number and the staff will bring the items to the customer's table.\n- Drinks: prices are suitable for such an investment. The drinks are delicious. When I go, I order yogurt tea and it feels refreshing. Haven't experienced the coffee section yet.\n- Cake: hot, crispy, delicious, good quality. Stored in a glass cabinet between warm cakes.\n\n- Staff: many, young, dynamic.\n- Toilet: clean, separate entrance for men and women.\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten August 2, 2023",
